# SAR → EO Image Translation (Pix2Pix)

Translate single-channel Sentinel-1 SAR (VV) patches into RGB Sentinel-2-style
optical imagery. This is the GalaxEye AI Research Intern assignment.

**Approach in one line:** a conditional GAN (Pix2Pix) — U-Net generator +
PatchGAN discriminator, trained with L1 + adversarial loss on paired,
co-registered SAR/optical patches. SAR-to-EO is ill-posed (no colour/spectral
information in SAR), so the goal is *plausible* optical imagery, judged mainly by
perceptual metrics (LPIPS, FID).

