  Sentinel-derived; Sentinel data © Copernicus / ESA.

**Methods**
- P. Isola, J.-Y. Zhu, T. Zhou, A. Efros. *Image-to-Image Translation with
  Conditional Adversarial Networks (Pix2Pix).* CVPR 2017.
- J.-Y. Zhu et al. *Unpaired Image-to-Image Translation (CycleGAN).* ICCV 2017.
- R. Zhang et al. *The Unreasonable Effectiveness of Deep Features as a Perceptual
  Metric (LPIPS).* CVPR 2018.
- M. Heusel et al. *GANs Trained by a Two Time-Scale Update Rule Converge to a
  Local Nash Equilibrium (FID).* NeurIPS 2017.

**Codebases consulted**
- pytorch-CycleGAN-and-pix2pix (Jun-Yan Zhu) — reference for the U-Net/PatchGAN.
- `lpips`, `pytorch-fid` — metric implementations.

